light 2\nbase ellipse 464..496 y=790..808; collar\nspout tip at (546,770) downward, small cylinder\nlever handle: from (480,770) to (440,762) with knob.\n```\nHmm spout at 550,770 over basin (y 770 > rim top 786? Actually inside basin y 800..845, so spout tip 770 is above rim, okay water would fall).\nHeight up to 700 overlapping window sill 678..732. Fine.\n\n- Sink inner dark gradient with highlight, no flat gray. Add subtle water reflection.\n- Fluted apron lines.\n\nLet's replace."}
