steam near 990-1110. I see a faint pale outline? not obvious. We should strengthen to alpha ~200, width 8, drawn after everything (currently after mugs but before crock/vase maybe flower stems overlap). Let's inspect crop of region to see. Use Image crop + upscale? Read image with crop via PIL to file. Let's crop 650..1250 x 520..850 and inspect."}
